-- Every assertion the grammar accepts, in one journey, so a form that stops
-- working stops working here rather than in somebody's spec.

journey EveryAssertionForm {
    goal: Exercise each form once against a world the spec can decide.

    cast:
        ada:  Member
        copy: catalogue/Copy

    given:
        ada.is_at_limit = false
        copy.status = available

    1. she borrows it
        ada does MemberBorrows(ada, copy) on MemberShelf
            creating loan: Loan
        then loan exists
        then reservation does not exist
        then copy.status != available
        then loan in Loans
        then loan in Reservations
        ada cannot see copy.shelfmark on MemberShelf
        then BorrowCopy fires
        then ReturnCopy does not fire

    ends: Every form ran and said something about this world.
}
